WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.381
Section B question three part (c). Estimate file size.

00:00:03.381 --> 00:00:12.460
One thousand nine hundred twenty times one thousand eighty times twenty-four, divided by eight, then divided by one thousand twenty-four squared.

00:00:12.460 --> 00:00:20.788
First get six million two hundred twenty thousand eight hundred; divide by one million forty-eight thousand five hundred seventy-six.

00:00:20.788 --> 00:00:22.792
About five point nine three M B.

00:00:22.792 --> 00:00:26.110
Accept five point nine three to five point nine four.

00:00:26.110 --> 00:00:33.624
Use one thousand twenty-four squared — not one thousand squared; do not forget divide by eight to convert bits to bytes.
